{"updated":"2026-10-18T09:13:49.058Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: France: Protests brought the entire population together for a common purpose. Elsewhere, france: Who took part in Saturday's protests?. And france: Who was behind the violence at Saturday's protests?. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 0.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 37 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.2 near 55 km NNW of Ruteng, Indonesia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.38,0.42,0.45,0.5,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.79,0.88,1.03,1.24,1.36,1.41,1.44,1.46,1.51,1.53,1.56,1.58,1.63,1.67,1.74,1.8,1.85,1.88,1.92,1.96,2,2.03,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.21,2.25,2.3,2.33,2.38,2.42,2.47,2.53,2.6,2.72,2.83,3.01,3.03,3.08,3.11,3.17,3.22,3.27,3.39,3.48,3.55,3.62,3.67,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.87,3.89,3.91,3.97,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.09,4.13,4.21,4.27,4.35,4.45,4.83,4.96,5,5.06,5.08,5.14,5.26,5.41,5.56,6.37,6.46,6.55,6.64,6.7,6.76,6.93,7.01,7.62,7.69,7.74,7.83,7.89,7.99,8.06,8.14,8.17,8.23,8.28,8.31,8.35,8.38,8.42,8.44,8.47,8.51,8.53,8.56,8.58,8.64,8.68,8.74,8.84,8.99,9.04,9.08,9.13,9.17,9.24,9.32,9.38,9.45,9.52,9.58,9.63,9.66,9.69,9.74,9.78,9.85,9.91,9.98,10.04,10.07,10.11,10.17,10.34,10.41,10.46,10.49,10.54,10.56,10.62,10.66,10.72,10.77,10.82,10.88,10.91,10.98,11.04,11.12,11.18,11.24,11.33,11.39,11.6,11.68,12,12.12,12.18,12.24,12.28,12.33,12.39,12.43,12.49,12.61,12.64,12.76,12.83,12.92,13.04,13.11,13.16,13.34,13.36,13.48,13.54,13.61,13.65,13.71,13.73,13.79,13.83,13.87,13.94,14,14.12,14.18,14.22,14.28,14.31,14.36,14.43,14.48,14.57,14.63,14.66,14.71,14.76